:INFO
Art. 1 Subject matter
This Act regulates the publication by the Federal Chancellery of:
a. the compilations of federal legislation (the Official Compilation of Federal Legislation, AS and the Classified Compilation of Federal Legislation, SR);
b. the Federal Gazette (BBl);
c. other texts related to legislation.
|

:NOTE
Art. 1 — Inserted by No I of the FA of 26 Sept. 2014, in force since 1 Jan. 2016 (AS 2015 3977; BBl 2013 7057).
Amended by No I of the FA of 26 Sept. 2014, in force since 1 Jan. 2016 (AS 2015 3977; BBl 2013 7057).
let. c — Inserted by No I of the FA of 26 Sept. 2014, in force since 1 Jan. 2016 (AS 2015 3977; BBl 2013 7057).
|

:INFO
Art. 1a Online publication
1 Publication under this Act takes place centrally via a publicly accessible online platform (the publications platform).
2 In principle, it also takes place in a form that is machine-readable and in which the current and all earlier versions are made available. The Federal Council shall specify the exceptions.
|

